WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.200
Who was Poeun Jeong Mong-ju? Meet the scholar and diplomat of late Goryeo.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:14.400
A choice before him. Tradition says he held to Goryeo despite an invitation to join a new dynasty.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:21.600
Dansimga. His answering poem speaks of an unwavering heart.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:28.800
A path changed by the wind. Tradition says a funeral banner blew down in Yongin in 1406.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:36.000
That is why Yongin remembers him: his tomb is in Mohyeon, home of the Poeun Festival.
